type: software
title: "cassis-colour-toolkit: reader, colour parameters and RGB composites for CaSSIS cubes"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/euchas/cassis-colour-toolkit"
url: "https://github.com/euchas/cassis-colour-toolkit"
authors:
  - family-names: Valantinas
    given-names: Adomas
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9995-3335"
    affiliation: "University of Cambridge"
keywords:
  - Mars
  - CaSSIS
  - ExoMars
  - Trace Gas Orbiter
  - colour imaging
  - spectral parameters
  - band depth
  - ISIS3
abstract: >-
  Python tools for the four-filter colour cubes of CaSSIS, the Colour and
  Stereo Surface Imaging System on the ExoMars Trace Gas Orbiter: an ISIS3
  cube reader with filter identification, decimated reads and a download
  completeness check; thirty colour and spectral-shape parameters (band
  ratios, continuum-removed band depths, spectral slopes, centred log-ratios
  and simplex angles, curvature, spectral moments, Legendre coefficients,
  entropy); four RGB composites; and a command line tool.
